WEBVTT

00:00:16.244 --> 00:00:21.124
Didn't I tell you guys we'd have fun in here?
Is this not the best?
我不是说过我们会很开心?

00:00:25.003 --> 00:00:27.130
Yeah, I'm working up a nice sweat.
我流了满身汗

00:00:27.213 --> 00:00:29.382
When's that Johnny kid
gonna be done party planning?
约翰尼几时完成派对筹划?他不错

00:00:29.465 --> 00:00:31.551
-He's a great hang.
-Yeah, he's an animal.
他很狂野.看到马维丝开心和他相处真好

00:00:31.634 --> 00:00:34.637
And it was so nice seeing Mavis
laughing and hitting it off with him.
他很狂野.看到马维丝开心和他相处真好

00:00:34.679 --> 00:00:37.307
Who's hitting what off? Please.
谁跟谁好相处?拜托

00:00:37.390 --> 00:00:40.810
Mavis could never be
with someone of his kind.
马维丝绝不会喜欢他这种人

00:00:40.894 --> 00:00:44.230
I'm sorry? "His kind"?
他这种?

00:00:44.314 --> 00:00:46.649
You're saying our kind's
not good enough for you,
你说我们这种不配你,大人?

00:00:46.691 --> 00:00:48.318
"Your Lordship"?
你说我们这种不配你,大人?

00:00:48.359 --> 00:00:50.153
No, no, no! Frank, I didn't...
不不!弗兰克!

00:00:50.195 --> 00:00:55.158
I meant that she wouldn't be into
someone with such red, curly hair.
我是说她不会喜欢卷红发的人

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:57.535
What's wrong with red, curly hair?
卷红发有什么不好?

00:00:57.660 --> 00:01:00.914
-Why are you getting upset?
-I have red curly hair!
我有卷红发!

00:01:00.997 --> 00:01:02.749
Well, how was I supposed to know that?
我怎么知道?

00:01:16.012 --> 00:01:21.517
This is the most incredible thing
I've ever seen.
这是我看过最神奇的东西

00:01:23.394 --> 00:01:24.896
Johnny?
约翰尼?

00:01:25.104 --> 00:01:26.439
Look, settle down, fellas.
冷静.全都是约翰尼引起,他走了!

00:01:26.522 --> 00:01:29.442
This is all a moot point
because Johnny, he left.
冷静.全都是约翰尼引起,他走了!

00:01:29.692 --> 00:01:30.944
Wait a minute. He left?
等等!他走了?

00:01:31.027 --> 00:01:34.364
Yes. He decided
he didn't like Mavis, or any of us.
是!他决定不喜欢马维丝和我们

00:01:36.908 --> 00:01:38.576
Hi.
嗨

00:01:38.701 --> 00:01:40.203
I guess Johnny had second thoughts.
我想约翰尼改变主意

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:54.592
I can't believe you stuck around, man.
You don't get it.
我不能相信你还在,天啊!

00:01:54.717 --> 00:01:56.886
Bad things are coming your way.
你不明白!你将遭遇不测!

00:01:56.970 --> 00:01:59.973
I got to get my thoughts together.
我必须仔细想想

00:02:00.056 --> 00:02:01.432
Okay.
好.你看到那些桌子吗?

00:02:01.557 --> 00:02:02.934
You see these tables?
好.你看到那些桌子吗?

00:02:03.059 --> 00:02:05.770
You can spend the entire day
pulling them out
你可以整天..

00:02:05.895 --> 00:02:07.897
and placing them, party planner.
排放它们,派对高手

00:02:07.981 --> 00:02:09.941
Fantastic. I'm trapped here.
太好了.我被困在这里

00:02:10.066 --> 00:02:12.068
Now I know how your daughter feels.
现在我知道你女儿的感受了

00:02:20.618 --> 00:02:22.287
Enough! Enough! Stop!
够了!住手!

00:02:22.453 --> 00:02:24.080
Go to a corner, you're in a timeout!
去角落,你被罚了!

00:02:24.122 --> 00:02:26.124
Timeout? I'm a grown man!
受罚?我是成年人!

00:02:31.754 --> 00:02:36.467
Okay. Table 57, please move to position 23.
57号桌子,请搬去位置23

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:42.932
-That is cool.
-Face the wall.
面向墙壁

00:02:42.974 --> 00:02:47.770
17 to 48. 16 to 47. 19 to 50.
16去47.19去50

00:02:49.772 --> 00:02:51.774
-Awesomeness.
-Just let me do my work.
让我专心工作!

00:02:51.816 --> 00:02:53.526
29 to 35.
29去35

00:02:53.609 --> 00:02:55.445
42 to 18. 10 to 44.
42去18, 10去44

00:02:55.778 --> 00:02:57.655
17, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22, 23.
17,18,19,20,21,22,23..

00:02:57.780 --> 00:02:59.198
39 to 24.
39去24

00:02:59.282 --> 00:03:00.658
36 up!
36起来!

00:03:00.783 --> 00:03:02.285
29 to 35.
29去35

00:03:10.793 --> 00:03:12.628
31 to 19.
31去19

00:03:18.968 --> 00:03:20.803
24 up!
24起来!

00:03:20.845 --> 00:03:23.514
Seven to 25. 14 to 30.
7去25

00:03:31.189 --> 00:03:34.984
-Where'd you go, grandpa?
-Don't freak out, gravity face.
不要怕,引力脸

00:03:35.485 --> 00:03:37.195
Eat my dust, gray fangs!
吃我的尘吧,灰獠牙!

00:03:37.445 --> 00:03:39.447
56 and 43, to my side.
56去43,去我旁边!

00:03:51.376 --> 00:03:53.669
Prepare to cry, Billy Backpack.
准备哭吧,背包小子

00:03:56.339 --> 00:04:00.885
-That's how we do it! Half-pipe, baby!
-Whatever.
我们是这样做的!半圆,宝贝!

00:04:03.638 --> 00:04:05.181
Yes. Keep smelling.
是的!保持微笑

00:04:05.348 --> 00:04:10.019
You catch the human,
and then I will make human potpie!
你捉到人类,我就做人肉派!

00:04:12.939 --> 00:04:16.651
27, 45, 65, 76, 48, block his path.
27, 45, 65, 76, 48,挡住他的路

00:04:16.984 --> 00:04:18.194
Block his path!
挡住他的路!

00:04:27.495 --> 00:04:29.455
Come on now, dude man!
来吧!好!

00:04:29.539 --> 00:04:31.082
Nice!
来吧!好!

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:40.133
I got you, buddy.
我捉到你了,朋友

00:04:43.052 --> 00:04:44.262
Do not disturb!
不要吵!我们要睡觉!

00:04:44.345 --> 00:04:45.680
People trying to sleep here!
不要吵!我们要睡觉!

00:04:58.818 --> 00:05:00.111
Did you see that?
你看到吗?那是谁,破坏王?

00:05:00.194 --> 00:05:02.738
Who is that guy, Sir Breaks-a-lot?
你看到吗?那是谁,破坏王?

00:05:02.822 --> 00:05:09.162
Oh, boy, I have to say, that was fun. Okay?
天啊,我必须说..

00:05:09.245 --> 00:05:13.583
The fun you were talking about earlier?
Nailed it!
知道吗?你之前说过的乐趣?

00:05:14.208 --> 00:05:16.085
Johnny?
约翰尼?

00:05:19.005 --> 00:05:20.381
Quasimodo!
卡西莫多?

00:05:28.306 --> 00:05:33.644
Mavis? Why are you still up? The sun is out.
It could kill you, my honeyguts.
太阳出来了.它可以杀死你,宝贝

00:05:33.728 --> 00:05:35.938
I couldn't sleep.
Do you know where Johnny went?
我睡不着.你知道约翰尼去了哪里吗?

00:05:36.022 --> 00:05:37.440
I don't know. He...
我不知道

00:05:37.523 --> 00:05:39.650
Why do you want to know?
为何你要知道?

00:05:39.734 --> 00:05:41.694
-Do you like him?
-What?
什么?!不

00:05:41.777 --> 00:05:44.989
No. Come on, Dad.
He's so weird and awkward.
拜托,爸.他很怪和笨拙

00:05:45.072 --> 00:05:48.284
It's like, are you an idiot
or do you know you're adorable?
令人觉得他是白痴抑或可爱?

00:05:51.037 --> 00:05:52.413
Hold that.
记住那想法

00:05:53.122 --> 00:05:55.249
-Do you have a location on Quasimodo?
-Yes, sir.
你有卡西莫多的位置吗?

00:05:55.333 --> 00:05:56.959
They're heading through the lobby,
towards the kitchen.
是的.他们经过大厅前往厨房

00:05:57.043 --> 00:05:58.377
I need them stopped immediately.
我要他们马上停.清楚吗?

00:05:58.461 --> 00:06:00.129
-Is that clear?
-Yes, quite.
我要他们马上停.清楚吗?

00:06:00.213 --> 00:06:01.714
We are on it.
很清楚!我们马上去办

00:06:08.429 --> 00:06:09.472
Missed!
捉不到!

00:06:12.558 --> 00:06:15.228
What is the meaning of this? Let me pass!
什么意思?让我过!

00:06:15.311 --> 00:06:17.772
Quasimodo Wilson, you are coming with us.
卡西莫多威尔森,你跟我们来!

00:06:20.399 --> 00:06:21.859
Why did that hurt me?
为何那会弄痛我?

00:06:25.279 --> 00:06:28.783
Look, honey,
there's no falling in love at your age.
宝贝,你这个年纪不应该恋爱

00:06:28.866 --> 00:06:31.494
Mom was my age.
Eunice says Mom kissed you first
尤尼斯说妈先吻你因为你害怕做主动

00:06:31.577 --> 00:06:33.579
'cause you were too scared
to make the first move.
尤尼斯说妈先吻你因为你害怕做主动

00:06:33.663 --> 00:06:35.164
Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
是是.忘掉我和妈接吻

00:06:35.248 --> 00:06:37.458
Forget about me and Mom and kissing.
是是.忘掉我和妈接吻

00:06:37.542 --> 00:06:40.294
Dad, at some point, I'm going to get married.
爸,在某个时候,我将结婚

00:06:40.461 --> 00:06:42.880
-I can't be here forever.
-What? Why not?
什么?为何不可以?

00:06:42.964 --> 00:06:45.967
You're barely out of your training fangs.
你还用着训练獠牙

